I am travelling by the metro train now.
I look at the route map above the door.
There are many lines on the map.
I do not know where those lines connect.
I am a little confused.
An older woman sits near me.
I ask her politely.
"Aunty, hello, can you help me?"
"I need to get near the sea."
"At which station do I alight to change the line?"
The woman smiles and says.
"Daughter, you alight at the next station."
"There you board the blue line's metro train."
"By that train you go near the sea."
I say with happiness.
"Thank you aunty, now I have no worry."
I wait for that station.
